1. Features currently available.
2. Features partially implemented.
3. Features planned for future development.

Only describe implemented capabilities as existing RevOS functionality.

### 2.1 Inspect the AI reasoning architecture

RevOS uses AI reasoning as a cross-cutting capability supporting different business engines.

Investigate how AI reasoning is actually used.

Determine:

- Whether AI receives structured user inputs.
