Do not invent provider names, model versions, training arrangements, retention periods or processing locations.

Detailed personal-data processing practices should be documented in the Privacy Policy rather than duplicated in this AI Disclaimer.

If relevant provider arrangements cannot be verified, flag them for owner confirmation.

